 <h3><u>Kya hai sakina</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Is baat se mehsoos karo kya hai sakina..(2)<br> abbas ke honton ka qaseeda hai sakina</p> 
  <p>1. Aaina e zehra mein jo dekha tera bachpan<br> har aks pukara ke tu zehra hai sakina</p> 
  <p>2. Jo pyaas k parcham ki alamdar hai ab tak<br> abbas ki woh pyari sakina hai sakina</p> 
  <p>3. Abbas ki nazron se koi padh ke to dekhe<br> ehsas ki ek nehjay balagha hai sakina</p> 
  <p>4. Jo mashk mein bhar sakta hai duniya ke samandar<br> konain mein bas woh tera saqqa hai sakina</p> 
  <p>5. Har umr k haider ne jhulaya tera jhoola<br> yeh auj faqat tu ne hi paaya hai sakina</p> 
  <p>6. Daryaon k labno k qalam choom rahay hain<br> mai ne abhi likha nahi socha hai sakina</p> 
  <p>7. Rehan ki surat woh sar afraz rahega<br> jis ne teri dehleez ko chooma hai sakina</p> 
